%% ============================================
%% FRONTISPIECE — "全書一句話" spread built on Leviticus's own resolution
%% verse (26:11-12), the same role Job 42:5-6, Acts 1:8 and Isaiah 12:2-3
%% play in the sister volumes.
%% ============================================
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.3in}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (-2.8,0) -- (-0.55,0);
  \fill[ScriptureGold] (0,0) circle (0.055);
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (0.55,0) -- (2.8,0);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterAsh} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
我要在你們中間立我的\textbf{\color{DawnGold!80!black}帳幕}；我的心也不厭惡你們。\\
我要在你們中間\textbf{\color{DawnGold!80!black}行走}；我要作你們的神，你們要作我的子民。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
I will make My \textbf{dwelling} among you, and My soul will not reject you.\\
I will also \textbf{walk} among you and be your God, and you shall be My people.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ChapterAsh} 利未記 26:11-12 \textperiodcentered\ Leviticus 26:11-12
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 二十七章 \textperiodcentered\ 六卷 \textperiodcentered\ 一句神要在百姓中間行走的應許\\
\textit{Twenty-seven chapters \textperiodcentered\ six volumes \textperiodcentered\ one promise that God will walk among His people}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{2.8cm}p{2.4cm}p{6.9cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{段落} & \textbf{章節} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
如何親近神 & 1-10章 & 五種獻祭的條例，及蒙揀選、按著神所吩咐受按立的祭司——親近神需要代價，也需要神所定的中保 \\
甚麼隔開人與神 & 11-15章 & 食物、生育、疾病、漏症的潔淨條例——不潔淨多與死亡、敗壞相連 \\
隔閡如何被除去 & 16章 & 大祭司一年一次，帶著血獨自進入至聖所——全書結構的樞紐 \\
蒙贖之後如何生活 & 17-27章 & 聖潔典章鋪陳生活的每一層面，末了收束於「我要在你們中間行走」的應許 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterAsh} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一份過時的規條清單，是來看一位聖潔的神，如何一步步預備一條路，使不潔的百姓能夠安全地與祂同住。\\
若你讀完二十七章卻只記得「一堆難懂的律例」——請從頭再讀，\\
這次留意：每一條律例最終指向的，不是規條本身，是那位「道成肉身住在我們中間」的基督。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
You are not reading an outdated list of regulations — you are watching a holy
God prepare, step by step, a way for an unclean people to dwell with Him
safely.\\
If after twenty-seven chapters you remember only "a pile of hard-to-follow
rules," read it again.\\
This time notice: every regulation points beyond itself to the Christ who
"became flesh and dwelt among us."}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

\vspace{0.3in}
